##TAKE THE PAYOUT FOR YOUR CLIPS 
Once you have published your clips and submitted the required analytics, the final step is to receive payment for your work.
The payout process depends on the campaign platform, payment structure and verification requirements.


Check your earnings - 
Open the campaign dashboard or payment section.
Check the status of your submitted clips.
Review the number of eligible views recorded.
Verify the earnings calculated for each clip.
Check whether your submissions have been approved or rejected.
Confirm that you have reached the minimum payout threshold, if applicable.


Set up your payment method - 
Before requesting a payout, make sure you have configured an accepted payment method.
Depending on the platform and campaign, payment options may include:
PayPal
Bank transfer
UPI
Stripe-supported payouts
Other payment methods specified by the campaign

NOTE - Payment methods vary by platform, country and campaign. Check withdrawal fees, currency conversion charges and identity verification requirements before proceeding.


Request your payout - 
Navigate to the campaign's earnings or wallet section.
Check your available balance.
Click the withdrawal or payout option, if available.
Select your preferred payment method.
Enter the required payment details.
Review the payout amount and applicable fees.
Submit your withdrawal request.
Wait for the platform to process your payment.


Track your payment - 
Details                  Example
Campaign                 Creator Campaign A
Total eligible views.    50,000
CPM                      ₹100
Gross earnings           ₹5,000
Payout status            Pending
Payment method           Bank transfer


Important considerations - 
Always check the campaign's payout terms before participating.
Make sure your submitted clips comply with campaign guidelines.
Never use bots, purchased views or artificial engagement.
Keep screenshots and records of approved submissions.
Be aware of minimum withdrawal thresholds and processing times.
Contact official campaign support if your payment is delayed beyond the stated processing period.
Never share your banking passwords, OTPs or account login credentials.
Track any platform fees and applicable taxes to calculate your actual profit.

